    "n6.hero.h1": "Underwater Archaeological Heritage Appraisal",
    "n6.hero.subtitle": "Cataloguing, authentication, and heritage valuation of artifacts and evidence recovered from colonial shipwrecks and underwater archaeological sites.",
    "n6.value.text": "Luis Manuel Almeida Luis applies the same technical appraisal and cataloguing protocols used for terrestrial cultural property to submerged evidence, adjusting the valuation scale to the historical-heritage significance and uniqueness of each recovered artifact.",
